<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PSCC Shift Manager</title>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/xlsx/0.18.5/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
<style>

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--bg:#0d1117;--s1:#161b22;--s2:#21262d;--brd:#30363d;--ac:#58a6ff;--gr:#3fb950;--or:#f78166;--yw:#d29922;--pu:#bc8cff;--mt:#8b949e;--txt:#e6edf3}
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);min-height:100vh;font-size:14px}
/* Layout */
.app-shell{display:flex;min-height:100vh;flex-direction:column}
.topbar{background:var(--s1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--brd);padding:10px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}
.topbar-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--ac)}
.topbar-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--mt);margin-top:2px}
.main{display:flex;flex:1}
.sidebar{width:270px;background:var(--s1);border-right:1px solid var(--brd);padding:16px;overflow-y:auto;flex-shrink:0;max-height:calc(100vh - 53px);position:sticky;top:53px}
.content{flex:1;padding:20px;overflow-y:auto}
/* Sidebar */
.slabel{font-size:9px;color:var(--mt);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:14px}
.slabel:first-child{margin-top:0}
select{width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brd);color:var(--txt);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:0;cursor:pointer;display:block}
select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--ac)}
.btn{width:100%;background:#238636;color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;margin-top:14px;transition:background .15s;display:block}
.btn:hover{background:#2ea043}
.btn-sec{background:var(--s2);color:var(--ac);border:1px solid var(--brd)}
.btn-sec:hover{background:var(--brd)}
/* Overlays */
.upload-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(13,17,23,.97);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:999}
.upload-card{background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--brd);border-radius:12px;padding:30px;max-width:460px;width:92%;text-align:center}
.upload-card h2{color:var(--ac);font-size:21px;margin-bottom:6px}
.upload-card p{color:var(--mt);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.6}
.file-drop{border:2px dashed var(--brd);border-radius:8px;padding:22px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;margin-bottom:12px;position:relative}
.file-drop:hover{border-color:var(--ac);background:rgba(88,166,255,.04)}
.file-drop input[type=file]{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;cursor:pointer;width:100%;height:100%}
.file-drop-icon{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:6px}
.file-drop-text{font-size:12px;color:var(--mt);line-height:1.6}
.upload-status{display:none;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap}
.upload-status.ok{background:#0e2d1b;color:#3fb950;border:1px solid rgba(63,185,80,.3)}
.upload-status.err{background:#2d1010;color:#f78166;border:1px solid rgba(247,129,102,.3)}
.upload-status.info{background:#0c1e35;color:#79c0ff;border:1px solid rgba(88,166,255,.3)}

/* Edit Modal */
.edit-modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(13,17,23,.9);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:1000}
.edit-card{background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--brd);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;width:320px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
.edit-card h3{color:var(--txt);margin-bottom:10px}
.edit-card input{width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brd);color:var(--txt);padding:10px;border-radius:6px;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px}
.edit-card input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--ac)}
.edit-btns{display:flex;gap:10px}

/* Stats */
.stats{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stat-card{background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--brd);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;flex:1;min-width:70px;text-align:center}
.stat-val{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--ac);line-height:1}
.stat-lbl{font-size:9px;color:var(--mt);text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:2px}
/* Schedule grid */
.sgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(92px,1fr));gap:6px;margin-bottom:14px}
.day-card{background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--brd);border-left:3px solid var(--brd);border-radius:6px;padding:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;user-select:none}
.day-card:hover{border-color:var(--ac)!important;background:#1c2128}
.day-card.off{background:#0f2a0f;border-left-color:rgba(63,185,80,.3)!important}
.day-card.sA{border-left-color:var(--gr)}.day-card.sB{border-left-color:var(--ac)}.day-card.sC{border-left-color:var(--or)}
.dc-date{font-size:9px;color:var(--mt);font-family:monospace}
.dc-day{font-size:9px;color:var(--mt);margin-bottom:3px}
.dc-sh{font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1}
.sA .dc-sh{color:var(--gr)}.sB .dc-sh{color:var(--ac)}.sC .dc-sh{color:var(--or)}
.day-card.off .dc-sh{color:var(--gr);font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}
.dc-desk{font-size:9px;color:var(--mt);margin-top:2px}
/* Tabs */
.ctabs{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid var(--brd);margin-bottom:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ctab{padding:8px 18px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--mt);cursor:pointer;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:none;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-right:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
.ctab:hover{color:var(--txt)}.ctab.act{color:var(--ac);border-bottom-color:var(--ac)}
.cpanel{display:none}.cpanel.act{display:block}
/* Result section header */
.sec-hdr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:16px 0 10px;font-size:11px;color:var(--mt);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold}
.sec-hdr::after{content:"";flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--brd)}
.cnt{background:var(--s2);border-radius:10px;padding:1px 8px;font-size:10px;color:var(--mt)}
.cnt.g{background:#0e2d1b;color:var(--gr)}.cnt.y{background:#2d2000;color:var(--yw)}
/* Result cards */
.rc{background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--brd);border-left:3px solid var(--brd);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px}
.rc.valid{border-left-color:var(--gr);background:#090f09}.rc.warn{border-left-color:var(--yw);background:#0f0c00}.rc.inf{border-left-color:var(--pu);background:#09070f}
.rc-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px}
/* Context row */
.ctx{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin:12px 0;background:var(--bg);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--brd)}
/* Badges */
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold}
.bA{background:#0e2d1b;color:#3fb950;border:1px solid rgba(63,185,80,.4)}
.bB{background:#0c1e35;color:#58a6ff;border:1px solid rgba(88,166,255,.4)}
.bC{background:#2d1010;color:#f78166;border:1px solid rgba(247,129,102,.4)}
.boff{background:#0f2a0f;color:#3fb950;border:1px solid rgba(63,185,80,.3)}
.bd{background:var(--s2);color:var(--mt);border:1px solid var(--brd)}
/* Give days table */
.gtable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px}
.gtable th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;color:var(--mt);font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--brd);background:var(--bg)}
.gtable td{padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--s2);vertical-align:middle}
.gtable tr.ccomp td{background:rgba(247,129,102,.06)}
.med-box{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brd);border-radius:6px;padding:10px;margin-top:8px}
.med-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--s2);flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11px}
.med-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.ibox{background:#0c1e35;border:1px solid rgba(88,166,255,.3);border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#79c0ff;margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.7}
.wbox{background:#2d2000;border:1px solid rgba(158,106,3,.4);border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#d29922;margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.7}
.empty{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:var(--mt);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}
details summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;color:var(--mt);padding:5px 0;list-style:none}
.rules-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:10px}
.rule{background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--brd);border-radius:6px;padding:12px}
.rule-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--ac);margin-bottom:4px}
.rule-desc{font-size:11px;color:var(--mt);line-height:1.6}
.sinfo{margin-top:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--mt);line-height:1.8;padding:10px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--brd)}
@media(max-width:700px){
  .main{flex-direction:column}
  .sidebar{width:100%;border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--brd);max-height:none;position:static}
  .sgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(80px,1fr))}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="upload-overlay" id="uploadOverlay">
  <div class="upload-card">
    <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:10px">&#9889;</div>
    <h2>PSCC Shift Manager</h2>
    <p>Upload your monthly shift schedule (.xlsx) to get started.<br>3-Way Bridging and C-Shift rules are fully automated.</p>

    <div class="file-drop" id="fileDrop">
      <input type="file" id="xlsxFile" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.pdf">
      <div class="file-drop-text">
        <b style="color:var(--txt)">Drop your file here or click to browse</b><br>
        <span style="color:#3fb950">&#10003; Reads Table 1 sheet &bull; Auto-detects operators</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="uploadStatus" class="upload-status"></div>
    <div style="margin:14px 0;color:var(--mt);font-size:11px">&#8213; OR &#8213;</div>
    <button class="btn" onclick="loadBuiltin();hideOverlay()">&#128197; Use Pre-loaded May 2026 Schedule</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="edit-modal" id="editModal">
    <div class="edit-card">
        <h3 id="editTitle">Edit Shift</h3>
        <p style="font-size:11px; color:var(--mt)">Leave blank for an OFF day.</p>
        <input type="text" id="editInput" placeholder="e.g. A1, B33-2, OFF">
        <div class="edit-btns">
            <button class="btn" onclick="saveEdit()">Save Change</button>
            <button class="btn btn-sec" style="margin-top:14px" onclick="closeEdit()">Cancel</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="app-shell">
  <div class="topbar">
    <div>
      <div class="topbar-title">&#9889; PSCC Shift Manager</div>
      <div class="topbar-sub">Power System Control Centre &middot; Live Editor & Export</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <span id="monthBadge" style="background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--brd);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ac);font-weight:bold">MAY 2026</span>
      <button class="btn" style="width:auto;padding:5px 12px;font-size:11px;margin:0;background:#1f6feb" onclick="exportExcel()">⬇️ Export Excel</button>
      <button class="btn btn-sec" style="width:auto;padding:5px 12px;font-size:11px;margin:0" onclick="document.getElementById('uploadOverlay').style.display='flex'">📁 Upload</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="main">
    <div class="sidebar">
      <div class="slabel">My Name</div>
      <select id="selName" onchange="onNameChange()"></select>
      
      <div class="slabel">Date</div>
      <select id="selDate" onchange="onDateChange()"></select>
      
      <div class="slabel">I Want To</div>
      <select id="selType" onchange="findOptions()">
        <option value="shift">Swap my shift with someone</option>
        <option value="off_want">Get this day OFF (I am working)</option>
        <option value="off_work">Work this day (I am OFF)</option>
      </select>
      
      <div class="slabel">Desired Shift Filter</div>
      <select id="selDesired" onchange="findOptions()">
        <option value="ANY">Any shift</option>
        <option value="A">A-Shift only</option>
        <option value="B">B-Shift only</option>
        <option value="C">C-Shift only</option>
      </select>
      
      <button class="btn" onclick="findOptions()">&#128269; FIND ALL OPTIONS</button>
      
      <div style="margin-top:24px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--brd)">
          <div class="slabel">Live Schedule Editor</div>
          <button id="editToggleBtn" class="btn btn-sec" style="margin-top:0" onclick="toggleEditMode()">✏️ Enable Edit Mode</button>
          <div style="font-size:10px; color:var(--mt); margin-top:8px; line-height:1.5">
              Turn on to edit any shift in the schedule grid dynamically. Changes log below.
          </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sinfo" id="sidebarInfo"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <div class="ctabs">
        <button class="ctab act" id="ctab-sched" onclick="switchTab('sched')">MY SCHEDULE</button>
        <button class="ctab" id="ctab-results" onclick="switchTab('results')">SWAP OPTIONS</button>
        <button class="ctab" id="ctab-log" onclick="switchTab('log')">CHANGE LOG</button>
        <button class="ctab" id="ctab-rules" onclick="switchTab('rules')">RULES</button>
      </div>

      <div class="cpanel act" id="cpanel-sched">
        <div id="schedOut"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cpanel" id="cpanel-results">
        <div id="resultsOut" class="empty">&#128269; Pick a date on the left and click<br><b>FIND ALL OPTIONS</b></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="cpanel" id="cpanel-log">
        <div class="rc" style="border-left-color:var(--gr); background:var(--bg); margin-bottom:20px;">
          <h3 style="color:var(--gr); font-size:14px; margin-bottom:12px; text-transform:uppercase">&#10003; Quick Log: Mutual Exchange</h3>
          <p style="font-size:11px; color:var(--mt); margin-bottom:12px">Select dates and operators. The dropdowns automatically show their current shift on that day so you can verify the trade.</p>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap">
            <div style="flex:1; min-width:120px">
              <label class="slabel">Swap Date 1</label>
              <select id="msD1" onchange="updateMutualSwapOperators()"></select>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1; min-width:120px">
              <label class="slabel">Operator 1</label>
              <select id="msP1"></select>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1; min-width:120px">
              <label class="slabel">Operator 2</label>
              <select id="msP2"></select>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1; min-width:120px">
              <label class="slabel">Swap Date 2 (Optional)</label>
              <select id="msD2"></select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button class="btn" style="width:auto; padding:8px 16px; margin-top:14px; background:var(--gr)" onclick="applyMutualSwap()">Apply &amp; Log Swap</button>
        </div>

        <div id="logOut"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cpanel" id="cpanel-rules">
        <div class="rules-grid">
          <div class="rule"><div class="rule-title">No Direct 33kV Swap</div><div class="rule-desc">If you are on an 11kV desk, you cannot swap directly with a 33kV desk. The app will automatically find a 3-way bridge mediator for you.</div></div>
          <div class="rule"><div class="rule-title">Same-Shift Desk Swap</div><div class="rule-desc">A 33kV-eligible person on an 11kV desk can swap desks with the 33kV operator on the identical shift, freeing up the 11kV desk.</div></div>
          <div class="rule"><div class="rule-title">Desk 1 Strict Eligibility</div><div class="rule-desc">33-1 Desk can only be operated by specific certified individuals.</div></div>
          <div class="rule"><div class="rule-title">C &rarr; A/B Forbidden</div><div class="rule-desc">Sequence rule: A or B shift cannot follow a C shift. The engine checks the pre and post days for everyone automatically.</div></div>
          <div class="rule"><div class="rule-title">Optional C-Shift Comp</div><div class="rule-desc">When swapping your C-shift, the app suggests optional future dates where you can take their C-shift in return.</div></div>
          <div class="rule"><div class="rule-title">Pragnya 33kV Restriction</div><div class="rule-desc">Pragnya can strictly only be assigned to 33kV desks.</div></div>
          <div class="rule"><div class="rule-title">Female A-Shift Only</div><div class="rule-desc">Female operators are restricted to A-Shift in mutual swaps.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
